// Renode platform description (.repl) for this board's MSS as the probe sees
// it. Start from the CPU and the console UART the probe prints on, then add
// each peripheral a probe touches. A device that only needs registers can be
// a `Memory` region or a tag; one that needs behaviour is a C# peripheral
// under peripherals/ referenced here.
//
// This is a starter: replace with the real board. Example shape:
//
// cpu: CPU.CortexM @ sysbus
//     cpuType: "cortex-m3"
//     nvic: nvic
//
// nvic: IRQControllers.NVIC @ sysbus 0xE000E000
//     -> cpu@0
//
// mmuart1: UART.NS16550 @ sysbus 0x40010000
//
// envm: Memory.MappedMemory @ sysbus 0x60000000
//     size: 0x80000
